          <div id="tab-workforce" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">AI Workforce <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">employees table · 10 records</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-6">Autonomous specialists configured with Brand DNA guardrails, memory, and specialized toolsets.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4" id="workforceGrid"></div></div>

          <div id="tab-studio" class="tab-content hidden">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Content Studio <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">content_posts table · tenant isolated</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Create and manage platform-native content — filtered by <span id="studioTenantName" class="text-indigo-400">current tenant</span></p></div><button onclick="createPost()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm font-medium">+ New Post</button></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6"><div class="lg:col-span-8"><div class="space-y-3" id="studioPostsList"></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-4"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-3">Create New Post</h3><input id="newPostTitle" placeholder="Post title..." class="w-full px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-zinc-500 outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 mb-3"/><textarea id="newPostContent" placeholder="Content..." rows="4" class="w-full px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-zinc-500 outline-none focus:border-indigo-500 mb-3"></textarea><select id="newPostPlatform" class="w-full px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-sm text-white mb-3"><option value="linkedin">LinkedIn</option><option value="instagram">Instagram</option><option value="x">X (Twitter)</option><option value="facebook">Facebook</option></select><select id="newPostWorkspace" class="w-full px-3 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-sm text-white mb-3"><option value="">Select Workspace (optional)</option></select><button onclick="createPost()" class="w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-white text-zinc-900 text-sm font-semibold">Create Draft</button></div></div></div>
          </div>

          <div id="tab-repurpose" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Repurpose Engine <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">POST /api/repurpose · 1 to 15</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-6">Feed 1 blog post or transcript. Get 15 platform-native assets.</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800"><textarea id="repurposeSource" placeholder="Paste your blog post, transcript, or long-form content here..." rows="10" class="w-full px-3 py-3 rounded-xl bg-zinc-950 border border-zinc-800 text-sm text-white placeholder:text-zinc-500 outline-none focus:border-indigo-500"></textarea><button onclick="runRepurpose()" class="w-full mt-3 py-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold">Repurpose to 15 Assets →</button></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-7"><div id="repurposeResult" class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 min-h-[300px] flex items-center justify-center text-zinc-500 text-sm">Results will appear here...</div></div></div></div>

          <div id="tab-leads" class="tab-content hidden"><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Leads CRM <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">leads table · tenant isolated</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Scored buying signals from comments, DMs, mentions — filtered by <span id="leadsTenantName" class="text-indigo-400">current tenant</span></p></div><div class="flex gap-2"><select id="leadsFilter" onchange="loadLeads()" class="px-3 py-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-xs text-white"><option value="">All Status</option><option value="new">New</option><option value="qualified">Qualified</option><option value="proposal">Proposal</option><option value="contacted">Contacted</option></select></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4" id="leadsGrid"></div></div>

          <div id="tab-agency" class="tab-content hidden">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Agency Hub — Multi-Tenant Management <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">agency_clients table · 6 tenants · white-label portals</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Manage 50+ client workspaces with custom domains, bespoke color schemes, and isolated client review portals. Each tenant gets /portal/:slug white-label URL.</p></div><button onclick="openCreateTenantModal()" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white text-sm font-semibold">+ New Client Workspace</button></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6">
              <div class="lg:col-span-8"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4" id="agencyGrid"></div></div>
              <div class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4">
                <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-3">White-Label Portal Features</h3><div class="space-y-3 text-xs text-zinc-400"><div class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Custom domain: portal.client.com</div><div class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Bespoke colors & logo</div><div class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Hide SIPRA branding toggle</div><div class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Isolated client review portal</div><div class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> Client users & role-based access</div><div class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-emerald-400">✓</span> 21 workspaces across 6 tenants</div></div><div class="mt-4 p-3 rounded-xl bg-indigo-950/30 border border-indigo-900/50 text-[11px] text-indigo-300">Each tenant: /portal/:slug<br/>Custom: https://portal.client.com<br/>Header: X-Tenant-Slug: slug<br/>Query: ?tenant=slug</div></div>
                <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800"><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-white mb-3">Tenant Isolation</h3><div class="text-xs text-zinc-400">All tables have client_id FK. Queries auto-filter by X-Tenant-Slug header or ?tenant= query or logged-in user's client_id. Owner sees all, client users see only their tenant.</div><div class="mt-3 text-[11px] font-mono text-zinc-500">Tables: content_posts, leads, approvals, social_accounts, inbox_messages, brand_dna, media_library, automations, analytics — all tenant-aware</div></div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="tab-workspaces" class="tab-content hidden"><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Workspaces <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">workspaces table · 21 records · per tenant</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Isolated workspaces per client — each with own posts, leads, approvals</p></div><button onclick="openCreateWorkspaceModal()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-white text-sm">+ New Workspace</button></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4" id="workspacesGrid"></div></div>

          <div id="tab-clients" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Client Users <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">users table · client_id FK · role-based</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-6">Users belonging to tenants — agency_owner, client_admin, client_user roles with tenant isolation</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-4" id="clientUsersGrid"></div></div>

          <div id="tab-invites" class="tab-content hidden"><div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-6"><div><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Invitations <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">invitations table · token-based</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400">Invite client users via email with role and expiring token link /invite/:token</p></div><button onclick="openInviteModal()" class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 text-white text-sm">+ Invite User</button></div><div class="space-y-3" id="invitesGrid"></div></div>

          <div id="tab-calendar" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Content Calendar <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">content_posts.scheduled_at · tenant isolated</span></h2><p class="text-zinc-400 text-sm mt-2">Calendar view from content_posts scheduled_at — filtered by current tenant</p><div id="calendarGrid" class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-7 gap-2"></div></div>
          <div id="tab-approvals" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Approvals <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">approvals table · tenant isolated · client review portal</span></h2><div id="approvalsGrid" class="mt-6 space-y-3"></div></div>
          <div id="tab-social" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Social Accounts <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">social_accounts table · 8 global + 2 per tenant</span></h2><div id="socialGrid" class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"></div></div>
          <div id="tab-inbox" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Inbox <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">inbox_messages table · tenant isolated</span></h2><div id="inboxGrid" class="mt-6 space-y-3"></div></div>
          <div id="tab-automations" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Automations <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">automations table · tenant isolated</span></h2><div id="automationsGrid" class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4"></div></div>
          <div id="tab-brand" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Brand DNA <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">brand_dna table · global + per tenant custom</span></h2><div id="brandGrid" class="mt-6 space-y-3"></div></div>
          <div id="tab-analytics" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Analytics <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">analytics table · tenant isolated · 30 days</span></h2><div id="analyticsGrid" class="mt-6 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-800 text-sm text-zinc-400">Analytics chart from /api/analytics?tenant=current — filtered per tenant</div></div>
          <div id="tab-audit" class="tab-content hidden"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Audit Logs <span class="text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">audit_logs table · owner/admin only</span></h2><p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 mb-6">All actions logged: login, create, update, delete, invite, run, repurpose — with user_id, client_id, IP</p><div id="auditGrid" class="space-y-2"></div></div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>

